# The boot (source/ezkernelnew.c, main): a card that mounts shows nothing
# until home comes in from black, every frame hashed from the boot's
# hand-over to home (v0.3.2: a "microSD card ready / Loading..." notice
# flashed for 3 frames, then faded out before the list)
-w "dialog: engine session handed over"
-H @0:@40
-w "screen ready: home"
-s @1:screen.png
